ts, with select units featuring maid’s rooms and study areas.</li><li><strong>Investment Potential:</strong> Located in Saadiyat Island—a hotspot for cultural, leisure, and residential developments by Aldar—promising long-term value.</li><li><strong>Minutes from Cultural Icons:</strong> Live near world-renowned attractions like Louvre Abu Dhabi and the upcoming Guggenheim Museum.</li><li><strong>Developed by Aldar: </strong>One of the UAE’s Most Trusted Developers<br>Confidence, quality, and commitment from a master developer with a strong delivery record.</li><li><strong>Limited Supply:</strong> Only 90 Units designed for exclusivity, privacy, and long-term investment stability.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":357,"cta":{"id":836,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mamsha_Gardens_at_Saadiyat_Island_Abu_Dhabi_by_Aldar_b8e717259c.jpg","hash":"Mamsha_Gardens_at_Saadiyat_Island_Abu_Dhabi_by_Aldar_b8e717259c","name":"Mamsha Gardens at Saadiyat Island, Abu Dhabi by Aldar"},"style":null,"title":"Beachfront Bliss: Mamsha Gardens at Saadiyat Island, Abu Dhabi by Aldar","heading":"location","bg_color":"white","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/saadiyat-island/\">Saadiyat Island</a> is Abu Dhabi’s crown jewel, offering an exceptional blend of natural beauty, cultural landmarks, and upscale living. Home to world-renowned institutions like the Louvre Abu Dhabi, NYU Abu Dhabi, and the upcoming Guggenheim, the island stands as the emirate’s cultural capital. With white-sand beaches, five-star resorts, and a prestigious residential landscape, Saadiyat Island attracts both discerning homeowners and global investors. Its master-planned layout ensures a tra